# Spec 7: find opened with `/` (vim style). Enter runs the search and gives the keys back to the document (query and
# highlights stay), n / N step, Esc clears and closes, `/` again brings the last query back selected. (find.mdscript
# covers Ctrl+F, where Enter = next and the field keeps focus.)
size 900 700
open find.md
keys /
type fox
expect-find field 8 1
shot typed.png
keys enter
expect-find doc 8 1
shot entered.png
keys n
expect-find doc 8 2
shot next.png
keys n n
expect-find doc 8 4
keys N
expect-find doc 8 3
keys esc
expect-find closed
shot closed.png
keys /
expect-find field 8 1
type dog
expect-find field 1 1
shot replaced.png
keys esc
expect-find closed
